+#: IEEE Std 802 "Local Experimental Ethertype 1". None of the 13 tutorials parsers (skeleton or
+#: solution) nor ndtwin_switch.p4 selects on it -- they use 0x0800, 0x0806, 0x0812, 0x1212, 0x1234
+#: and 0x88CC; the table is in the segment H SUMMARY and the check is in the test.
